@local/dsh-project-board README · 1. 拖 → 改状态：把卡片拖到另一列，松手即写回 `projects.yaml`，4 秒内可撤销。

落哪一列决定写哪个词：代码型拖到「在做」是 `building`，素材型拖到「在做」是 `editing`。
拖动过程不碰文件；松手才写。

@local/dsh-project-board README · Install：**Restart `dsh web` afterwards.** The client plugin manifest is scanned once per process;
without a restart the sidebar row never appears. After that, editing `lib/client.js` only
needs a page refresh — only `package.json`'s `dsh.client` block needs another restart.
